## Supplement 2026-05-18 — Parallel Docker sandbox and Fetch frame hardening

### Intent

Make the Kafka 4.2 differential lab safe under Rust's default parallel test execution and fix the read-path evidence harness so it sends a complete Jansu Fetch request frame instead of failing on test-frame shape.

### Files Touched

- `jansu-broker/tests/differential_lab.rs`
- `etc/differential/compose.kafka-4.2.yaml`
- `docs/compatibility/differential-lab.md`
- `phase-logs/04-differential-kafka-lab.md.log`
- `phase-logs/attempts/04-differential-kafka-lab/20260518-103907-codex.md`

### Verification Commands

- `env CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/jansu-verify-phase04-differential-pr11 cargo test --jobs 20 -p jansu-broker --test differential_lab --all-features -- --nocapture`
- `env CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/jansu-verify-phase04-contract-pr11 cargo test --jobs 20 -p jansu-broker --test compatibility_contract --all-features -- --nocapture`
- `env JANSU_DIFFERENTIAL=1 JANSU_DIFF_ARTIFACT_DIR=target/differential CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/jansu-verify-phase04-differential-pr11 cargo test --jobs 20 -p jansu-broker --test differential_lab --all-features -- --nocapture`
- `env JANSU_DIFFERENTIAL=1 JANSU_DIFF_ARTIFACT_DIR=target/differential CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/jansu-verify-phase04-differential-pr11 cargo test --jobs 20 -p jansu-broker --test differential_lab --all-features -- --nocapture` (stress rerun)

### Outcomes

- Docker-managed Kafka now uses a generated Compose project name, generated container name, and free localhost port per test instance.
- Auto-port startup retries clean up the failed sandbox and allocate a fresh Compose project/container/port; fixed `JANSU_DIFF_KAFKA_PORT` retries keep the caller's requested port.
- `JANSU_DIFF_KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP` remains the external Kafka escape hatch.
- Jansu-side Produce and Fetch evidence now uses direct sans-io frames. Kafka reference offsets and consumption remain via librdkafka to avoid conflating Apache Kafka compatibility with harness frame-construction issues.
- The Fetch evidence request uses v12 with explicit session, forgotten-topic, and rack fields, matching the flexible request shape Jansu's frame layer expects.
- The Docker-backed differential suite passed twice under parallel test execution.

### Residual Risks

- `differential_librdkafka_full_lifecycle` remains ignored until later Fetch/ListOffsets/group API promotion work.
- Fetch/ListOffsets remain unadvertised compatibility evidence and do not change the ApiVersions contract.
